{"type":"assistant.message","data":{"messageId":"0bb4a333-e3fd-478a-a294-1eae95dbb767","content":"","toolRequests":[{"toolCallId":"call_MHxNOEJnSEVxUThOYWlUWFRKdE0","name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"endLine\":145,\"filePath\":\"/Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/docs/.vitepress/theme/index.ts\",\"startLine\":130}","type":"function"}],"reasoningText":"**Investigating Registration Errors**\n\nI'm currently focused on understanding the Vue warning about the \"Badge\" component being registered twice. My immediate step is to examine the `@pantoken/docs` repository to see if its private nature is contributing to this conflict, and then explore potential solutions.\n\n**Resolving Redundant Enhancements**\n\nI've pinpointed the issue: the `Badge` component was being registered twice because the VitePress theme configuration explicitly re-called `DefaultTheme.enhanceApp` after it was already implicitly invoked. I've removed the redundant call to resolve this.\n\n"},"id":"218d73c7-4e6c-43d3-b424-9348076faba7","timestamp":"2026-09-11T20:56:35.261Z","parentId":"c109c2ff-1a3a-4f62-9007-457786631ade"}
